<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.560" end="00:00:04.400" style="s2">Do [music] you take her as your wife?</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.680" end="00:00:09.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU CAN&#39;T MARRY HER.</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.880" end="00:00:09.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AILEEN?</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.800" end="00:00:14.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DAMIEN, you are marrying this pig?</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.880" end="00:00:15.800" style="s2">Please, Damien.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.080" end="00:00:19.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Get down.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.800" end="00:00:19.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you promised me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.920" end="00:00:22.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.240" end="00:00:25.680" style="s2">Talk.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.200" end="00:00:28.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.800" end="00:00:33.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.080" end="00:00:33.960" style="s2">I did promise you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.000" end="00:00:39.760" style="s2">Your father&#39;s shares are finally mine.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.610" end="00:00:43.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.560" end="00:00:43.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.230" end="00:00:46.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.440" end="00:00:49.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; transfer the shares to him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.400" end="00:00:53.320" style="s2">Only he can keep the company alive.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.560" end="00:00:53.320" style="s2">I won&#39;t marry anyone but him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.120" end="00:01:03.520" style="s2">No, you promised my father.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.280" end="00:01:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You idiot. Who could ever love a pig?</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.199" end="00:01:10.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was already carrying Damien&#39;s child.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.680" end="00:01:12.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Ryan, you&#39;ve served your purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.240" end="00:01:14.960" style="s2">You can leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.960" end="00:01:17.040" style="s2">Don&#39;t bother. Could that necklace even</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.960" end="00:01:19.910" style="s2">fit around your neck?</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.040" end="00:01:20.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the only thing my dad left me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.910" end="00:01:21.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.520" end="00:01:23.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drag her out.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.840" end="00:01:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, please cooperate.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.240" end="00:01:27.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.400" end="00:01:29.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s so heavy, I can&#39;t even drag her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.440" end="00:01:31.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A wedding dress at your size? Have you</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.600" end="00:01:34.280" style="s2">no shame?</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.120" end="00:01:35.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No wonder even your dad didn&#39;t want you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.280" end="00:01:38.560" style="s2">Oh, right.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.880" end="00:01:38.560" style="s2">He&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.526" end="00:01:43.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.720" end="00:02:00.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fat pig.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.212" end="00:02:06.252" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.252" end="00:02:06.252" style="s2">he lied to us.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.092" end="00:02:12.012" style="s2">I failed you, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.052" end="00:02:12.012" style="s2">I&#39;ll avenge you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.372" end="00:02:18.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that?</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.372" end="00:02:19.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You scare this easily and you want</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.861" end="00:02:21.292" style="s2">[music] revenge?</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.972" end="00:02:22.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.292" end="00:02:23.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The thing you were wearing around your</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.492" end="00:02:24.756" style="s2">neck.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.532" end="00:02:25.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wha- What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.756" end="00:02:27.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.092" end="00:02:28.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My life is all I have left. If you want</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.412" end="00:02:30.012" style="s2">it, take it. It&#39;s not like my life Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.932" end="00:02:32.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. Stop. [music] Don&#39;t you want</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.012" end="00:02:32.692" style="s2">revenge?</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.932" end="00:02:36.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.212" end="00:02:36.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obviously. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.772" end="00:02:40.252" style="s2">I can help you,</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.132" end="00:02:41.532" style="s2">but there&#39;s a price.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.252" end="00:02:44.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What price?</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.532" end="00:02:46.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A blood pact. Your blood for my power.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.972" end="00:02:49.572" style="s2">I can turn you into someone else. So</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.852" end="00:02:51.012" style="s2">beautiful, no one will recognize you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.572" end="00:02:53.652" style="s2">But every transformation has a [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.012" end="00:02:55.172" style="s2">time limit. When it runs out, you change</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.652" end="00:02:57.532" style="s2">back. Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.172" end="00:02:58.161" style="s2">Scared? Then stay fat and cry yourself</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.532" end="00:03:00.181" style="s2">to death.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.161" end="00:03:00.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.732" end="00:03:03.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do I sign?</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.747" end="00:03:07.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.732" end="00:03:07.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your blood. Drip it onto the pendant.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.572" end="00:03:23.762" style="s2">90 minutes, starting now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.742" end="00:03:23.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.172" end="00:03:36.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My clothes. The clothes didn&#39;t change.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.372" end="00:03:38.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, forgot to tell you. Your clothes</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.532" end="00:03:39.092" style="s2">don&#39;t change with you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.052" end="00:03:42.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.092" end="00:03:42.092" style="s2">I have to get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.852" end="00:03:51.812" style="s2">This is my face.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.182" end="00:03:54.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.692" end="00:03:56.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m back.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.892" end="00:03:59.077" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We try again tomorrow. Just stay alive</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.692" end="00:04:01.097" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.077" end="00:04:01.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.774" end="00:04:08.774" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here we go again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.142" end="00:04:16.334" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.574" end="00:04:17.934" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, I&#39;m Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.334" end="00:04:19.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A first name without a last name? A</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.934" end="00:04:20.037" style="s2">background check will show you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.094" end="00:04:21.814" style="s2">exist.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.037" end="00:04:22.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.814" end="00:04:24.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.854" end="00:04:26.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pick a family name. One with more clout</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.654" end="00:04:28.553" style="s2">than Ross.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.654" end="00:04:28.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.553" end="00:04:31.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.854" end="00:04:31.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sterling.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.654" end="00:04:35.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sterling? Who?</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.694" end="00:04:37.174" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucas Sterling. [music] Started in</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.374" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">building materials, now he&#39;s in real</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.174" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">estate and shipping, too.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.734" end="00:04:50.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 403, your trash bag&#39;s leaking outside</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.054" end="00:04:52.494" style="s2">your door.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.694" end="00:04:55.374" style="s2">Never mind. I put it in the trash can</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.494" end="00:04:55.374" style="s2">outside for you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.494" end="00:04:59.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re gone.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.614" end="00:05:01.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You [music] scare this easily and you</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.894" end="00:05:03.923" style="s2">want revenge?</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.214" end="00:05:05.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m being careful.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.923" end="00:05:05.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.014" end="00:05:14.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Claire Sterling, correct?</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.014" end="00:05:16.368" style="s2">Your interview&#39;s on the 12th floor. Turn</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.894" end="00:05:18.388" style="s2">right, second room.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.368" end="00:05:18.388" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.334" end="00:05:25.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember, distant Sterling relative,</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.374" end="00:05:27.694" style="s2">just back from [music] overseas. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.974" end="00:05:30.134" style="s2">say anything else.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.694" end="00:05:30.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.174" end="00:05:32.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.088" end="00:05:36.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.694" end="00:05:37.334" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here for an interview. Claire Sterling.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.254" end="00:05:39.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sterling? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.334" end="00:05:43.334" style="s2">Which Sterlings?</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.974" end="00:05:43.334" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With a face like that, you&#39;re trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.878" end="00:05:47.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.094" end="00:05:49.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, that woman practically glued her</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.254" end="00:05:51.793" style="s2">eyes on you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.773" end="00:05:51.793" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.934" end="00:05:55.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire Sterling, back from [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.414" end="00:05:57.934" style="s2">overseas?</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.494" end="00:06:00.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, California. I came back late last</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.934" end="00:06:00.214" style="s2">year.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.254" end="00:06:03.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About your degree.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.614" end="00:06:06.775" style="s2">Your degree checks [music] out. We</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.614" end="00:06:08.135" style="s2">verified your reference, too.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.775" end="00:06:08.975" style="s2">Ms. Sterling, why did you choose our</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.135" end="00:06:10.535" style="s2">company?</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.975" end="00:06:11.815" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ross Group offers the best opportunities</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.535" end="00:06:14.295" style="s2">in town. I want [music] to start at the</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.815" end="00:06:14.295" style="s2">bottom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.535" end="00:06:18.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. We&#39;ll let you know in the</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.615" end="00:06:18.594" style="s2">next couple of days.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.095" end="00:06:20.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.594" end="00:06:20.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.855" end="00:06:26.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll wear the gray outfit tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.454" end="00:06:28.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.735" end="00:06:29.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A skirt that&#39;s too short could expose</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.375" end="00:06:32.215" style="s2">too much.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.575" end="00:06:35.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve even planned tomorrow&#39;s outfit.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.215" end="00:06:35.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t mess up my first day.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.655" end="00:06:42.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone&#39;s watching you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.855" end="00:06:43.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.829" end="00:06:46.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.135" end="00:06:47.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even I don&#39;t recognize myself now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.055" end="00:06:48.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, right? Start by entering this</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.735" end="00:06:49.495" style="s2">quarter&#39;s expense claims into the</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.855" end="00:06:52.054" style="s2">system.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.495" end="00:06:52.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.415" end="00:07:06.655" style="s2">Such a tiny desk.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.135" end="00:07:06.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hair takes up half of it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.055" end="00:07:10.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty or not, you&#39;re still just a</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.455" end="00:07:10.975" style="s2">typer.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.994" end="00:07:12.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.455" end="00:07:16.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s afraid of you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.855" end="00:07:16.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, she&#39;s jealous of me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.895" end="00:07:19.735" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I didn&#39;t mean to.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.509" end="00:07:22.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.735" end="00:07:22.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.095" end="00:07:28.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are Are you all right, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.175" end="00:07:29.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.680" end="00:07:32.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat and music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.335" end="00:07:32.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First day. Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.095" end="00:07:35.215" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.195" end="00:07:39.215" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.535" end="00:07:44.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The new hire in administration today,</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.055" end="00:07:46.855" style="s2">Claire. Pull her entire onboarding file.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.255" end="00:07:46.855" style="s2">Send it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.335" end="00:07:52.335" style="s2">It&#39;s late. Still here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.255" end="00:07:53.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The expense [music] claims are due</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.335" end="00:07:55.815" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.975" end="00:07:56.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here. The decimal point&#39;s in the wrong</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.815" end="00:07:58.155" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.895" end="00:07:58.215" style="s2">Fix it, then head home.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.155" end="00:07:59.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.215" end="00:08:02.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t stay too late.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.495" end="00:08:03.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I&#39;ll fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.175" end="00:08:05.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s your first day. You don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.455" end="00:08:07.737" style="s2">push yourself so [music] hard.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.055" end="00:08:10.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I do a good job.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.737" end="00:08:10.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unless</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.080" end="00:08:26.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.937" end="00:08:27.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 105 minutes. 90 yesterday. Why 15</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.320" end="00:08:29.337" style="s2">[music] more?</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.417" end="00:08:31.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The closer you get to him, the more you</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.337" end="00:08:33.697" style="s2">need Claire to keep existing. The longer</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.737" end="00:08:35.057" style="s2">you need her to stay, the more time you</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.697" end="00:08:36.800" style="s2">get.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.057" end="00:08:36.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one stretching the time.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.800" end="00:08:39.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.857" end="00:08:41.385" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Today, you got another step closer</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.657" end="00:08:43.097" style="s2">to earning his trust. You didn&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.385" end="00:08:44.657" style="s2">[music] that to stop. So, you got more</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.097" end="00:08:46.337" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.657" end="00:08:46.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When he leaned in earlier</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.337" end="00:08:48.657" style="s2">my face</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.977" end="00:08:50.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few more seconds and the skin across</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.657" end="00:08:51.857" style="s2">your face would have split open. If he&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.537" end="00:08:53.831" style="s2">looked at your face, you&#39;d have been</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.857" end="00:08:55.057" style="s2">done for.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.831" end="00:08:55.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.057" end="00:08:57.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He didn&#39;t see.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.737" end="00:08:58.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not this time. What if he gets closer</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.497" end="00:09:00.617" style="s2">next time?</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.857" end="00:09:03.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I keep my distance.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.617" end="00:09:04.577" style="s2">He moves closer, I step back. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.257" end="00:09:06.897" style="s2">let him cross that line.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.577" end="00:09:08.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Step back and you won&#39;t get more time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.897" end="00:09:10.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough for him to remember me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.817" end="00:09:12.697" style="s2">Keeping my secret matters more than</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.137" end="00:09:12.697" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.937" end="00:09:16.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.756" end="00:09:19.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.977" end="00:09:19.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sterling</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.217" end="00:09:23.817" style="s2">Have Claire join me tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.457" end="00:09:43.617" style="s2">Working [music] late again?</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.737" end="00:09:43.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just wrapping up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.417" end="00:09:48.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Sterling heiress</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.177" end="00:09:50.897" style="s2">three tries [music] to fix an expense</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.497" end="00:09:50.897" style="s2">claim.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.057" end="00:09:58.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad runs the company, Mom handles the</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.757" end="00:10:01.296" style="s2">[music] money, I handle eating.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.217" end="00:10:01.337" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you can&#39;t line up the decimals.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.296" end="00:10:03.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.337" end="00:10:05.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can. I&#39;m just not used to it. Got a</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.697" end="00:10:07.457" style="s2">problem with that?</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.577" end="00:10:09.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The problem [music] is your onboarding</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.457" end="00:10:12.178" style="s2">form says you went to business school.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.417" end="00:10:14.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Studied it, never used it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.178" end="00:10:15.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you never use it, why put it down?</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.018" end="00:10:18.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks good on a resume.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.658" end="00:10:18.498" style="s2">You read it, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.858" end="00:10:22.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t [music] lie next time.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.418" end="00:10:26.338" style="s2">High school graduate, that I&#39;d believe.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.978" end="00:10:26.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should I care what you believe?</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.497" end="00:10:31.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.898" end="00:10:31.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.392" end="00:10:37.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.018" end="00:10:40.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.538" end="00:10:40.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.907" end="00:10:43.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.218" end="00:10:56.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. I&#39;ll drive you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.352" end="00:10:56.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.902" end="00:11:02.922" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.107" end="00:11:10.127" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.898" end="00:11:14.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The weather&#39;s changing. My skin&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.258" end="00:11:17.338" style="s2">little dry.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.418" end="00:11:18.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s stuffy in here. Don&#39;t cover it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.338" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">Where do you live?</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.218" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maple Road.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.418" end="00:11:30.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, take the contracts [music] to</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.778" end="00:11:30.298" style="s2">Mr. Ross&#39;s office. He needs them now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.618" end="00:11:35.298" style="s2">Watch where you&#39;re going. I just sorted</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.738" end="00:11:37.498" style="s2">these. If anything goes missing, can you</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.298" end="00:11:39.548" style="s2">handle the consequences?</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.498" end="00:11:41.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.548" end="00:11:43.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.538" end="00:11:46.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New hires never know their place.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.578" end="00:11:46.978" style="s2">What are you waiting for? Pick them up.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.718" end="00:11:52.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.738" end="00:11:54.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon&#39;s left-handed. Stand half a step</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.658" end="00:11:55.268" style="s2">behind him on his right. Keep his left</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.378" end="00:11:56.778" style="s2">hand clear.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.268" end="00:11:59.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.778" end="00:11:59.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.163" end="00:12:03.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.178" end="00:12:06.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.713" end="00:12:09.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.178" end="00:12:14.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Page three flags last week&#39;s updated</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.858" end="00:12:16.539" style="s2">guidelines. I&#39;ve checked them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.899" end="00:12:18.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, you bring me the contracts.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.539" end="00:12:20.259" style="s2">Skip the [music] admin supervisor.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.139" end="00:12:21.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, Mr. Ross. If that&#39;s all, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.259" end="00:12:23.433" style="s2">get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.379" end="00:12:24.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.433" end="00:12:27.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.699" end="00:12:30.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re very thorough. Quite useful.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.419" end="00:12:30.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Force of habit.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.258" end="00:12:35.278" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.859" end="00:12:40.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New hires really know how to work an</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.139" end="00:12:42.579" style="s2">angle. Already running to the CEO&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.139" end="00:12:43.819" style="s2">office after just a few days?</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.579" end="00:12:46.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better than standing around like some</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.819" end="00:12:49.033" style="s2">people. No real work, just a pretty</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.219" end="00:12:49.033" style="s2">decoration. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.939" end="00:12:56.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ross, honestly, anyone could bring</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.099" end="00:12:56.139" style="s2">them before. Now he insists on Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.803" end="00:13:02.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.819" end="00:13:03.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought this baby would secure my</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.259" end="00:13:05.139" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.459" end="00:13:06.259" style="s2">Then this blonde shows up out of</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.139" end="00:13:09.339" style="s2">nowhere.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.259" end="00:13:09.339" style="s2">Who the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.019" end="00:13:15.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Department dinner tonight. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.219" end="00:13:17.419" style="s2">celebrating the project&#39;s approval.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.979" end="00:13:19.659" style="s2">Damon specifically asked me to invite</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.419" end="00:13:19.659" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.699" end="00:13:22.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another dinner? I was planning to go</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.579" end="00:13:25.179" style="s2">home and rest. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.819" end="00:13:25.179" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.624" end="00:13:29.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.209" end="00:13:36.099" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.619" end="00:13:36.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.859" end="00:13:39.019" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.179" end="00:13:49.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, you&#39;re way too pretty for admin</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.059" end="00:13:52.899" style="s2">work, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.299" end="00:13:52.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here for the paycheck. What else?</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.899" end="00:14:03.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m heading that way. I&#39;ll drive you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.739" end="00:14:03.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, thanks. I live nearby, I&#39;ll walk.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.779" end="00:14:09.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s dark.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.579" end="00:14:09.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.419" end="00:14:14.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s literally following you in his car.</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.459" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">He&#39;s into you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.739" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He kept watching my left hand.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.661" end="00:14:32.741" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon&#39;s mother loved dark blue.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.941" end="00:14:32.741" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.901" end="00:14:37.941" style="s2">Why is he here, too?</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.861" end="00:14:42.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone has one.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.141" end="00:14:45.341" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Damon. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.261" end="00:14:45.341" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First one to refuse me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.981" end="00:14:49.141" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.101" end="00:14:50.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oops, sorry. That dress looks expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.141" end="00:14:51.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. It&#39;s not expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.810" end="00:14:53.141" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.021" end="00:14:54.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pregnancy can make you unstable.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.141" end="00:14:55.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.221" end="00:14:57.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Erin,</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.821" end="00:15:00.301" style="s2">are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.781" end="00:15:00.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.220" end="00:15:07.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.581" end="00:15:09.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to tell everyone something.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.701" end="00:15:12.341" style="s2">Damon and I&#39;s baby is almost 3 months</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.861" end="00:15:12.341" style="s2">old.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.901" end="00:15:21.741" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw her today. She wore that blue</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.781" end="00:15:23.941" style="s2">dress on purpose. She thinks she is</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.741" end="00:15:25.341" style="s2">special.</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.941" end="00:15:26.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say it again. Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.341" end="00:15:28.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire&#39;s overseas business school has no</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.661" end="00:15:29.061" style="s2">admission record. Her name isn&#39;t in any</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.221" end="00:15:30.301" style="s2">alumni list.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.061" end="00:15:31.541" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the Sterling family?</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.301" end="00:15:32.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no Claire in the public branch</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.541" end="00:15:33.301" style="s2">family records.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.381" end="00:15:34.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send the paper files to my house</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.301" end="00:15:36.621" style="s2">immediately. I&#39;ll transfer the money</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.261" end="00:15:36.621" style="s2">later.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.781" end="00:15:41.900" style="s2">Some people sit pretty comfortably.</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.301" end="00:15:42.061" style="s2">Aren&#39;t they afraid of falling someday?</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.900" end="00:15:43.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.061" end="00:15:45.141" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you have time to worry about others,</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.461" end="00:15:46.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; fix your own expense reports.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.141" end="00:15:48.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They were rejected three times last</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.461" end="00:15:49.760" style="s2">week. Isn&#39;t that embarrassing?</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.501" end="00:15:49.941" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll expose you soon.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.760" end="00:15:53.581" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.941" end="00:15:53.581" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see how proud you can stay.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.021" end="00:16:03.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.861" end="00:16:04.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.181" end="00:16:07.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you in such a hurry?</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.381" end="00:16:09.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon, Claire is a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.061" end="00:16:11.221" style="s2">The overseas university she wrote has no</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.101" end="00:16:13.301" style="s2">admission record. Even the alumni list</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.221" end="00:16:15.061" style="s2">doesn&#39;t have her name. The construction</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.301" end="00:16:17.661" style="s2">company that recommended her is an empty</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.061" end="00:16:17.661" style="s2">shell.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.181" end="00:16:24.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HR is [music] on the proper process.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.142" end="00:16:25.982" style="s2">Don&#39;t make assumptions.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.742" end="00:16:27.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t believe me? I</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.982" end="00:16:30.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.702" end="00:16:30.342" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.822" end="00:16:39.102" style="s2">Bring the quarterly contracts.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.506" end="00:16:45.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.742" end="00:16:47.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Damon, the contracts are ready.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.702" end="00:16:48.582" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you were a distant branch of the</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.022" end="00:16:49.702" style="s2">Sterling family.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.582" end="00:16:50.542" style="s2">How come Lucas never mentioned you</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.702" end="00:16:52.502" style="s2">before?</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.542" end="00:16:54.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only a distant branch. We haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.502" end="00:16:55.942" style="s2">been close for years. I don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.022" end="00:16:56.902" style="s2">rely on my family name after returning.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.942" end="00:16:58.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The construction company that</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.902" end="00:16:58.462" style="s2">recommended you, are you familiar with</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.182" end="00:17:00.102" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.462" end="00:17:02.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My family arranged it. I wasn&#39;t involved</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.102" end="00:17:02.902" style="s2">in the operation.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.911" end="00:17:17.222" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.742" end="00:17:18.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Review all of Claire&#39;s employment</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.222" end="00:17:20.302" style="s2">documents again.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.862" end="00:17:22.942" style="s2">Check everything carefully. Don&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.302" end="00:17:22.942" style="s2">anyone know.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.702" end="00:17:51.102" style="s2">Wait, isn&#39;t this Claire?</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.582" end="00:17:54.702" style="s2">Little cousin, finally.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.262" end="00:17:59.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.452" end="00:18:01.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.662" end="00:18:03.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t expect to meet you here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.502" end="00:18:05.582" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call me Mr. Sterling. Call me</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.142" end="00:18:05.582" style="s2">cousin.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.582" end="00:18:17.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was telling the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.302" end="00:18:23.623" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling, welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.343" end="00:18:27.543" style="s2">This is my distant sister, Claire. She</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.423" end="00:18:28.927" style="s2">just came back and wants to gain</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.543" end="00:18:29.223" style="s2">experience here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.927" end="00:18:31.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.223" end="00:18:32.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re Mr. Sterling&#39;s sister. No</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.143" end="00:18:36.383" style="s2">wonder you&#39;re capable.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.663" end="00:18:36.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Damon, you flatter me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.263" end="00:18:45.463" style="s2">The real person is here, but why is he</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.103" end="00:18:48.343" style="s2">helping you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.463" end="00:18:48.343" style="s2">I&#39;m wondering, too.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.143" end="00:19:00.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I covered your identity. This pen is</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.103" end="00:19:00.703" style="s2">your proof.</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.988" end="00:19:06.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.503" end="00:19:06.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You owe me a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.463" end="00:19:11.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you helping me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.863" end="00:19:13.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big girl,</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.143" end="00:19:13.943" style="s2">you don&#39;t remember [music] me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.023" end="00:19:18.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you recognize me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.863" end="00:19:19.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because of it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.183" end="00:19:21.743" style="s2">I gave it to you when we were in high</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.263" end="00:19:21.743" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.903" end="00:19:26.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You draw better than me. It&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.943" end="00:19:30.823" style="s2">It&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.498" end="00:19:33.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.823" end="00:19:33.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You finally remembered.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.463" end="00:19:38.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you leave back then?</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.703" end="00:19:41.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.383" end="00:19:41.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll talk later.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.223" end="00:19:47.423" style="s2">Don&#39;t thank me yet. There will be plenty</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.943" end="00:19:47.423" style="s2">of chances to settle this debt.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.343" end="00:19:56.263" style="s2">The Sterling Overseas Construction</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.703" end="00:19:56.983" style="s2">Factory, how much revenue did it make</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.263" end="00:19:58.983" style="s2">last year?</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.983" end="00:20:02.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over 300 million. I need to check the</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.983" end="00:20:02.303" style="s2">report for the exact number.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.143" end="00:20:07.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; During your years studying abroad, what</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.623" end="00:20:07.983" style="s2">was your mentor&#39;s name?</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.833" end="00:20:12.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.983" end="00:20:12.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hanson. Specialized in supply chain.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.183" end="00:20:18.343" style="s2">The mentor name was wrong. Don&#39;t panic.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.623" end="00:20:25.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The files are organized well.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.305" end="00:20:26.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a habit.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.545" end="00:20:28.585" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The paper clips all face the same</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.829" end="00:20:29.465" style="s2">[music] direction. Keep doing it this</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.585" end="00:20:31.105" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.465" end="00:20:33.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Organizing files is something anyone can</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.105" end="00:20:33.465" style="s2">do.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.425" end="00:20:41.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What he said just now was a test.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.985" end="00:20:41.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.705" end="00:20:55.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Aaron&#39;s profile and this is</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.145" end="00:20:57.945" style="s2">Claire&#39;s. Aaron has followed Damon for 5</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.705" end="00:20:59.665" style="s2">years. Claire joined less than a month</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.945" end="00:21:01.305" style="s2">ago and entered the joint venture team</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.665" end="00:21:03.545" style="s2">directly.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.305" end="00:21:05.985" style="s2">What is Aaron doing recently?</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.545" end="00:21:08.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is investigating Claire&#39;s education,</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.985" end="00:21:10.105" style="s2">but she hasn&#39;t found anything useful.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.265" end="00:21:11.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can&#39;t find anything because Lucas is</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.105" end="00:21:13.785" style="s2">protecting her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.905" end="00:21:15.265" style="s2">Aaron is too careless.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.785" end="00:21:17.225" style="s2">She can&#39;t even investigate a person</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.265" end="00:21:18.705" style="s2">properly.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.225" end="00:21:21.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Claire?</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.705" end="00:21:22.985" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She joined the company for 1 month.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.065" end="00:21:25.905" style="s2">Damon moved her into the core project</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.985" end="00:21:27.865" style="s2">and made her report directly to him.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.905" end="00:21:29.465" style="s2">Aaron followed him for 5 years and never</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.865" end="00:21:31.065" style="s2">achieved that.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.465" end="00:21:33.025" style="s2">No matter who she is, she is at least</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.065" end="00:21:34.665" style="s2">more capable than Aaron.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.025" end="00:21:35.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your meaning is to leave her alone for</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.665" end="00:21:37.505" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.545" end="00:21:39.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why touch her?</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.505" end="00:21:41.425" style="s2">Damon needs someone decent beside him.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.745" end="00:21:43.185" style="s2">Someone like Aaron will ruin him sooner</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.425" end="00:21:44.545" style="s2">or later.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.185" end="00:21:47.905" style="s2">Keep watching.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.545" end="00:21:47.905" style="s2">See if she can really stand.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.105" end="00:22:02.585" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She changed your file. She switched the</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.665" end="00:22:03.345" style="s2">version.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.585" end="00:22:07.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which version?</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.345" end="00:22:07.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The cover is the same. Check page three.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.185" end="00:22:14.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her change it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.425" end="00:22:15.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t do anything?</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.665" end="00:22:17.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The longer it stays on the desk, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.905" end="00:22:21.145" style="s2">the worse it will look in the meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.705" end="00:22:21.145" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. You&#39;re ruthless.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.305" end="00:22:28.986" style="s2">The last cloud edit was Friday at 4:00</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.906" end="00:22:29.746" style="s2">p.m. The modifier ID belongs to Aaron.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.986" end="00:22:31.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aaron?</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.746" end="00:22:31.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t touch her files. She did it</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.306" end="00:22:33.186" style="s2">herself.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.946" end="00:22:35.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the version you replaced had a</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.186" end="00:22:38.540" style="s2">decimal error on page three. The final</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.586" end="00:22:38.540" style="s2">version was correct. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.466" end="00:22:42.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll talk after the meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.746" end="00:22:49.106" style="s2">From now [music] on, report the project</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.346" end="00:22:49.106" style="s2">directly to me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.186" end="00:22:55.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Victoria asked me to tell you</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.626" end="00:22:57.786" style="s2">something. She said your ability to</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.546" end="00:22:59.586" style="s2">investigate people is poor.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.786" end="00:23:01.386" style="s2">But she will give you a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.586" end="00:23:02.065" style="s2">Next week&#39;s family dinner, go with</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.386" end="00:23:02.466" style="s2">Damon.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.065" end="00:23:04.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.466" end="00:23:08.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is she helping me? She wants to know</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.346" end="00:23:08.346" style="s2">who can stand out more, you or Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.236" end="00:23:13.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.546" end="00:23:28.786" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Damon, you have a fever.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.226" end="00:23:31.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.786" end="00:23:31.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.506" end="00:23:41.066" style="s2">Hurry. You don&#39;t have much time. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.066" end="00:23:47.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Ryan [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.826" end="00:23:47.466" style="s2">can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.746" end="00:23:51.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay calm. He&#39;s delirious.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.826" end="00:23:55.826" style="s2">Mr. Damon, you&#39;re mistaken.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.826" end="00:23:58.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.826" end="00:23:58.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Medicine is here.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.906" end="00:24:08.306" style="s2">Less than 10 minutes left.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.066" end="00:24:28.827" style="s2">It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.067" end="00:24:41.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.427" end="00:24:41.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.227" end="00:24:46.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come to my office tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.947" end="00:24:50.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She noticed you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.947" end="00:24:54.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what I wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.507" end="00:25:03.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some people still at the company this</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.347" end="00:25:06.507" style="s2">late?</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.107" end="00:25:06.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop pretending to work hard.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.388" end="00:25:13.148" style="s2">That fat woman who ran away that night</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.028" end="00:25:14.867" style="s2">probably hasn&#39;t forgotten this button.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.148" end="00:25:17.307" style="s2">Looking at it, seems to be yours,</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.867" end="00:25:17.307" style="s2">Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.547" end="00:25:21.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister Aaron, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.947" end="00:25:24.427" style="s2">where the button came from, you know</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.707" end="00:25:24.427" style="s2">better than me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.388" end="00:25:33.788" style="s2">This button was dropped by that woman on</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.028" end="00:25:37.427" style="s2">the rainy night, right at the fire</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.788" end="00:25:37.427" style="s2">escape. She must be connected to Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.347" end="00:25:41.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What can one button prove?</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.547" end="00:25:41.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can it not prove? That night Claire</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.067" end="00:25:42.542" style="s2">was at the company.</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.827" end="00:25:42.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aaron,</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.542" end="00:25:44.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.707" end="00:25:46.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you&#39;re pregnant staring at others.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.028" end="00:25:46.827" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you tired?</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.908" end="00:25:52.187" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.107" end="00:25:52.187" style="s2">Stop stirring trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.427" end="00:26:08.742" style="s2">Good proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.867" end="00:26:10.827" style="s2">Government relations, you lead from now</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.742" end="00:26:13.227" style="s2">[music] on.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.827" end="00:26:13.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.947" end="00:26:21.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The one Lucas gave is too flashy. Use</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.067" end="00:26:21.467" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.987" end="00:26:25.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Damon.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.707" end="00:26:33.549" style="s2">Just this?</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.788" end="00:26:35.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And her education. I checked, that</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.549" end="00:26:35.389" style="s2">school has no record of her. She&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.189" end="00:26:36.949" style="s2">fake.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.389" end="00:26:37.949" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About the education, Lucas vouched for</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.949" end="00:26:40.229" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.949" end="00:26:42.148" style="s2">You can&#39;t touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.229" end="00:26:43.309" style="s2">You investigate yours, I&#39;ll watch mine.</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.148" end="00:26:45.549" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.309" end="00:26:46.909" style="s2">When there are results, show me first.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.549" end="00:26:48.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You suspect her, too?</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.909" end="00:26:50.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t suspect her.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.549" end="00:26:52.669" style="s2">I&#39;m watching to see if she can actually</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.429" end="00:26:56.309" style="s2">stand beside Damon. If you can&#39;t [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.669" end="00:26:56.309" style="s2">stand, then don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.989" end="00:27:03.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Overall budget cut by three points.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.789" end="00:27:06.589" style="s2">Suppliers already negotiated, won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.429" end="00:27:06.589" style="s2">affect delivery timeline.</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.109" end="00:27:11.509" style="s2">The bald guy on the left is sneering. He</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.269" end="00:27:14.429" style="s2">flipped through three pages of your</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.509" end="00:27:14.429" style="s2">files just now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.069" end="00:27:18.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unanimously approved.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.189" end="00:27:25.189" style="s2">Project Deputy Director, Claire,</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.709" end="00:27:25.189" style="s2">report directly to me from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.929" end="00:27:33.949" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.309" end="00:27:37.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon, how long has she been in the</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.829" end="00:27:38.989" style="s2">company? Less than a month, promoted to</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.629" end="00:27:40.949" style="s2">Deputy Director?</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.989" end="00:27:43.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because she can get things done.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.949" end="00:27:44.669" style="s2">Can you?</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.109" end="00:27:46.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I followed you for 5 years. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.669" end="00:27:49.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 years with me and you can&#39;t even fix</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.229" end="00:27:51.789" style="s2">expense reports. Get out. Stop making a</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.229" end="00:27:51.789" style="s2">scene here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.869" end="00:28:00.149" style="s2">Pushing this hard? Want me to remember</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.429" end="00:28:03.349" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.149" end="00:28:03.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want the reports to look better.</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.949" end="00:28:06.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I first started, I pulled</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.029" end="00:28:08.229" style="s2">all-nighters, too.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.749" end="00:28:10.029" style="s2">One person doing three people&#39;s work,</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.229" end="00:28:11.509" style="s2">nobody to help.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.029" end="00:28:14.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened after?</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.509" end="00:28:15.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Later, cleared out everyone in my way.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.029" end="00:28:18.989" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When he said cleared out, his eyes were</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.629" end="00:28:18.989" style="s2">off. Be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.349" end="00:28:22.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s an industry gathering at my</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.589" end="00:28:24.029" style="s2">place this weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.309" end="00:28:26.669" style="s2">Just familiar faces.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.029" end="00:28:26.669" style="s2">You should come.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.909" end="00:28:33.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He didn&#39;t say that casually.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.629" end="00:28:37.830" style="s2">He&#39;s inviting you into his world.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.550" end="00:28:41.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.830" end="00:28:41.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.324" end="00:28:44.830" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.510" end="00:28:46.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.830" end="00:28:48.070" style="s2">If I don&#39;t step in,</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.310" end="00:28:49.550" style="s2">how will I find his weakness?</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.070" end="00:28:51.430" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire has been promoted to project</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.550" end="00:28:53.350" style="s2">deputy director, reporting directly to</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.430" end="00:28:56.110" style="s2">Damon. These are all the projects she</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.350" end="00:28:57.750" style="s2">has handled since joining.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.110" end="00:29:00.550" style="s2">One month,</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.750" end="00:29:03.270" style="s2">a newcomer became a deputy director.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.550" end="00:29:06.310" style="s2">Aaron spent 5 years and never got there.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.270" end="00:29:08.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucas is still protecting her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.310" end="00:29:10.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can protect her for now, but not</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.230" end="00:29:10.750" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.830" end="00:29:14.110" style="s2">Arrange a meeting with Lucas.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.830" end="00:29:15.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What will you discuss?</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.110" end="00:29:16.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.150" end="00:29:19.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether the person he&#39;s protecting is</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.750" end="00:29:19.390" style="s2">worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.590" end="00:29:30.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where to?</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.390" end="00:29:30.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Delivering contracts.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.105" end="00:29:35.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.550" end="00:29:36.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the agreement from my study. Second</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.550" end="00:29:38.750" style="s2">drawer.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.390" end="00:29:38.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.790" end="00:29:43.190" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He gave you his house key?</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.150" end="00:29:45.830" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He trusts me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.190" end="00:29:45.830" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already?</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.710" end="00:30:10.230" style="s2">This thing, why does he keep it?</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.785" end="00:30:12.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.230" end="00:30:12.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.506" end="00:30:27.526" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.150" end="00:30:33.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t touch anything [music] else?</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.470" end="00:30:34.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the agreement.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.070" end="00:30:35.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the first person who entered my</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.310" end="00:30:38.672" style="s2">study and didn&#39;t snoop around.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.952" end="00:30:41.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t touch what isn&#39;t yours.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.672" end="00:30:43.191" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unfortunately, some people don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.752" end="00:30:43.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wanted you to see those things.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.191" end="00:30:44.152" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.472" end="00:30:45.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.152" end="00:30:48.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why go?</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.472" end="00:30:48.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I need the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.512" end="00:30:55.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon gave Claire his house key. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.152" end="00:30:56.632" style="s2">She stayed inside less than 20 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.872" end="00:30:58.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The study?</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.632" end="00:31:00.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Most likely. She went to get the joint</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.112" end="00:31:02.432" style="s2">venture agreement.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.872" end="00:31:06.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.432" end="00:31:08.272" style="s2">He actually let her into his study.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.032" end="00:31:11.312" style="s2">A newcomer with too much trust. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.272" end="00:31:11.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should we investigate her?</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.552" end="00:31:15.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep an eye on [music] her.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.112" end="00:31:17.251" style="s2">Don&#39;t let her touch what she shouldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.912" end="00:31:19.271" style="s2">Report every document to me immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.251" end="00:31:19.271" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.832" end="00:31:23.472" style="s2">For years, few people could make Damon</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.552" end="00:31:25.752" style="s2">feel at ease.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.472" end="00:31:29.472" style="s2">You&#39;re an exception.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.752" end="00:31:29.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Damon just has high standards.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.592" end="00:31:34.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People with high standards need someone</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.112" end="00:31:34.231" style="s2">who understands [music] them.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.192" end="00:31:40.152" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s watching you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.392" end="00:31:43.471" style="s2">She&#39;s Damon&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.152" end="00:31:43.471" style="s2">That&#39;s why it&#39;s dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.592" end="00:31:51.512" style="s2">Claire,</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.792" end="00:31:54.792" style="s2">Damon&#39;s private party,</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.512" end="00:31:54.792" style="s2">you seem quite familiar here.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.352" end="00:32:01.672" style="s2">Aaron,</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.592" end="00:32:01.672" style="s2">be careful with the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.471" end="00:32:10.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who invited you?</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.912" end="00:32:10.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just wanted to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.307" end="00:32:13.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.592" end="00:32:13.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or you came to see her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.792" end="00:32:21.352" style="s2">Take her home.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.592" end="00:32:26.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your jacket.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.682" end="00:32:28.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.832" end="00:32:30.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful next time.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.312" end="00:32:30.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.912" end="00:32:36.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He put the jacket on you himself. Your</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.152" end="00:32:36.072" style="s2">time increased.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.752" end="00:32:42.553" style="s2">It started from that moment.</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.073" end="00:32:42.553" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.833" end="00:32:46.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The West City project [music] is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.153" end="00:32:52.282" style="s2">Are you still staying at that hotel?</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.153" end="00:32:52.282" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.673" end="00:32:56.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move into my place.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.073" end="00:32:59.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.713" end="00:32:59.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your choice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.273" end="00:33:08.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He asked you to move in.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.113" end="00:33:10.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.433" end="00:33:12.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You refused?</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.433" end="00:33:14.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I accept too easily, he&#39;ll suspect</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.353" end="00:33:14.633" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.833" end="00:33:21.753" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re really going to move.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.553" end="00:33:23.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.753" end="00:33:25.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Moving into his house, seeing him every</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.633" end="00:33:27.273" style="s2">day, when he [music] gets close and you</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.233" end="00:33:29.593" style="s2">get emotional, the time increases. The</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.273" end="00:33:33.033" style="s2">crack spreads, too. Your right ear area</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.593" end="00:33:33.033" style="s2">already reaches your jawline.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.593" end="00:33:43.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not enough time. [music] Can&#39;t hold out</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.793" end="00:33:43.713" style="s2">till the net closes.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.033" end="00:33:51.193" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This [music] room, bedding is new.</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.633" end="00:33:51.193" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.793" end="00:33:56.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, I&#39;ll have someone move the</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.993" end="00:33:58.273" style="s2">archives [music] here. Just organize</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.353" end="00:34:00.313" style="s2">them here. I live upstairs. Call me if</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.273" end="00:34:02.713" style="s2">you need anything.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.313" end="00:34:04.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That touch increased your time. Only 15</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.713" end="00:34:05.993" style="s2">minutes. The more time you gain, the</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.433" end="00:34:07.393" style="s2">worse the cracks [music] become.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.993" end="00:34:08.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.393" end="00:34:10.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, I&#39;ll enter his study.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.873" end="00:34:12.553" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you really ready to get closer to</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.233" end="00:34:12.553" style="s2">him?</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.153" end="00:34:36.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the sugar?</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.373" end="00:34:39.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.433" end="00:34:39.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Left drawer.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.553" end="00:34:43.674" style="s2">It happened again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.394" end="00:34:48.474" style="s2">Damon, I was just passing by.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.834" end="00:35:03.994" style="s2">Looks like there&#39;s a new owner here.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.434" end="00:35:03.994" style="s2">I&#39;m only here to organize files.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.674" end="00:35:10.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.914" end="00:35:11.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re protecting her?</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.354" end="00:35:13.764" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her staying here was my decision.</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.744" end="00:35:13.764" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.994" end="00:35:21.634" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.554" end="00:35:22.834" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.634" end="00:35:24.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She won&#39;t bother you [music] again.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.834" end="00:35:27.074" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t stop her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.314" end="00:35:27.074" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.034" end="00:35:30.914" style="s2">Your ear, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.354" end="00:35:32.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe it&#39;s the heat.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.914" end="00:35:33.874" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It increased again. You got too close to</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.914" end="00:35:34.994" style="s2">him today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.874" end="00:35:36.474" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.994" end="00:35:38.274" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you looking for?</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.474" end="00:35:41.234" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The note from yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.274" end="00:35:41.234" style="s2">Someone entered my room.</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.834" end="00:36:06.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.714" end="00:36:09.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 6 seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.714" end="00:36:09.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.274" end="00:36:22.274" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like living with Damon is treating</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.914" end="00:36:24.474" style="s2">you well.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.274" end="00:36:26.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t forget, he has a child.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.474" end="00:36:30.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.914" end="00:36:30.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Erin, your lipstick is crooked.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.480" end="00:36:44.796" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.994" end="00:36:46.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve lost weight recently.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.796" end="00:36:48.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t notice.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.516" end="00:36:48.685" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you say you&#39;re fine, usually you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.036" end="00:36:50.705" style="s2">not.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.685" end="00:36:50.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.116" end="00:36:55.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fourth time today.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.396" end="00:36:55.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.996" end="00:37:00.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your left side is starting to keep going</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.116" end="00:37:03.076" style="s2">like this and you&#39;ll collapse first.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.676" end="00:37:03.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.676" end="00:37:08.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He left them there.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.316" end="00:37:09.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow I&#39;m going to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.116" end="00:37:12.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For Aaron?</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.276" end="00:37:12.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to confirm something.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.885" end="00:37:18.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.436" end="00:37:18.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.116" end="00:37:22.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hospital, a checkup.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.916" end="00:37:30.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll drive you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.916" end="00:37:30.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.156" end="00:37:37.956" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come back early.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.396" end="00:38:01.596" style="s2">Check her out to the hospital.</p>
