<p begin="00:50:13.644" end="00:50:17.604" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon, come outside for a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.404" end="00:50:18.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Just say it here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.604" end="00:50:20.164" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure you want her to hear this?</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.964" end="00:50:21.404" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s with me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.164" end="00:50:24.444" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does she know who you are?</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.404" end="00:50:25.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t matter. I don&#39;t care.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.444" end="00:50:27.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In 3 days, [music] the board will</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.524" end="00:50:29.524" style="s2">reconsider your authority.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.924" end="00:50:32.724" style="s2">Protect her if you want, but don&#39;t lose</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.524" end="00:50:32.724" style="s2">yourself in the process.</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.844" end="00:50:34.764" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shouldn&#39;t go against her because of</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.164" end="00:50:36.684" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.764" end="00:50:38.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going against her.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.684" end="00:50:41.484" style="s2">I just chose you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.724" end="00:50:42.510" style="s2">Board meeting in 3 days. Stand by me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.484" end="00:50:44.530" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.510" end="00:50:44.530" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.130" end="00:50:47.150" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.404" end="00:50:51.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Twice today,</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.124" end="00:50:52.724" style="s2">Damon got close to you, Victoria</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.244" end="00:50:55.564" style="s2">pressured you to sign, [music] and you</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.724" end="00:50:56.764" style="s2">still held it in.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.564" end="00:50:58.884" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.764" end="00:51:00.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 320 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.884" end="00:51:04.245" style="s2">Keep going, and half your face will be</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.845" end="00:51:04.245" style="s2">permanently paralyzed.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.365" end="00:51:08.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First on the agenda,</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.045" end="00:51:10.730" style="s2">re-assessing Damon&#39;s management</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.605" end="00:51:10.730" style="s2">authority. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.885" end="00:51:17.845" style="s2">A new hire has been given access to core</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.845" end="00:51:19.605" style="s2">projects and financial authority.</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.845" end="00:51:21.885" style="s2">I propose we suspend the changes to</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.605" end="00:51:25.005" style="s2">Damon&#39;s authority.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.885" end="00:51:26.725" style="s2">All in favor, [music] raise your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.005" end="00:51:28.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I object.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.725" end="00:51:30.605" style="s2">She handled the Westside project and</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.360" end="00:51:32.645" style="s2">[music] the financial approvals.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.605" end="00:51:34.485" style="s2">If anything goes wrong,</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.645" end="00:51:35.845" style="s2">I&#39;ll take [music] responsibility.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.485" end="00:51:38.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And how exactly will you take</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.845" end="00:51:38.845" style="s2">responsibility?</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.525" end="00:51:42.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, I&#39;m late.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.485" end="00:51:48.885" style="s2">The Sterling family [music] owns 12% of</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.285" end="00:51:51.925" style="s2">Ross. I have the right to be here.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.885" end="00:51:53.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is an internal Ross matter.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.925" end="00:51:56.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t stand by while my sister is</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.445" end="00:51:57.845" style="s2">being targeted.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.245" end="00:52:00.285" style="s2">I propose postponing the vote until next</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.845" end="00:52:00.285" style="s2">Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.845" end="00:52:05.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The vote is postponed. Meeting</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.805" end="00:52:06.350" style="s2">adjourned.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.165" end="00:52:08.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the evidence will be in place in</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.350" end="00:52:08.925" style="s2">[music] 3 days.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.165" end="00:52:12.925" style="s2">Did you arrange for Lucas to be there?</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.901" end="00:52:14.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.925" end="00:52:17.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s my cousin.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.725" end="00:52:19.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much more haven&#39;t you told me?</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.125" end="00:52:20.685" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never asked.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.525" end="00:52:24.485" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.685" end="00:52:26.645" style="s2">Board meeting next Monday. Stand by me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.485" end="00:52:28.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucas just publicly picked a side. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.645" end="00:52:29.925" style="s2">backing Damon, [music] not me. Is there</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.525" end="00:52:32.645" style="s2">a difference?</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.925" end="00:52:35.165" style="s2">Yes. If he backs Damon, Damon will trust</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.645" end="00:52:35.165" style="s2">me more.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.525" end="00:52:52.885" style="s2">Damon knows you signed the authorization</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.245" end="00:52:54.485" style="s2">on your father&#39;s behalf.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.885" end="00:52:56.365" style="s2">He knows.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.485" end="00:52:57.925" style="s2">But he never said anything.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.365" end="00:53:00.405" style="s2">He&#39;s waiting for you to make the first</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.925" end="00:53:00.405" style="s2">move.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.725" end="00:53:03.405" style="s2">So I did.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.407" end="00:53:11.967" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t accept the review [music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.367" end="00:53:11.967" style="s2">result.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.087" end="00:53:19.407" style="s2">The file you copied is timestamped 2:00</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.327" end="00:53:20.366" style="s2">in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.407" end="00:53:23.367" style="s2">You were at a prenatal appointment</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.366" end="00:53:23.367" style="s2">[music] that night.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.607" end="00:53:31.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been looking [music] at it for 10</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.847" end="00:53:31.327" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.887" end="00:53:35.927" style="s2">But I&#39;ve always felt like something was</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.327" end="00:53:35.927" style="s2">missing.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.487" end="00:53:39.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A person is missing.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.727" end="00:53:44.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what I&#39;ve always thought, too.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.727" end="00:53:53.687" style="s2">Have you been here before?</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.767" end="00:53:56.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.687" end="00:54:01.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came here alone 3 years ago. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.647" end="00:54:05.967" style="s2">I just lost my father then.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.247" end="00:54:10.647" style="s2">A lot changed during that time.</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.407" end="00:54:16.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People change.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.247" end="00:54:16.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.847" end="00:54:24.007" style="s2">Financial approval authority.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.567" end="00:54:25.647" style="s2">From now on,</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.007" end="00:54:27.687" style="s2">your signature is enough to authorize</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.647" end="00:54:30.447" style="s2">Ross funds.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.687" end="00:54:30.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Full authority?</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.567" end="00:54:34.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have the nerve to take it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.607" end="00:54:38.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I take it, you won&#39;t have a way</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.347" end="00:54:38.927" style="s2">[music] out.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.247" end="00:54:45.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need one.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.327" end="00:54:53.767" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 340 minutes left.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.847" end="00:54:57.927" style="s2">Keep going and the left side of your</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.767" end="00:54:57.927" style="s2">face will be permanently paralyzed.</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.927" end="00:55:06.607" style="s2">Lucas&#39;s people are gone.</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.967" end="00:55:06.607" style="s2">He&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.728" end="00:55:14.288" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.768" end="00:55:18.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling, there&#39;s no trace of that</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.528" end="00:55:20.048" style="s2">sister of yours.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.768" end="00:55:21.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s from a collateral branch of the</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.048" end="00:55:23.168" style="s2">Sterling family. It&#39;s normal that you</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.568" end="00:55:24.808" style="s2">can&#39;t find much.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.168" end="00:55:27.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is she [music] really?</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.808" end="00:55:27.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.568" end="00:55:29.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know she&#39;s investigating [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.728" end="00:55:30.608" style="s2">the Lane case?</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.768" end="00:55:31.848" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.608" end="00:55:32.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.848" end="00:55:35.368" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a question you should ask your</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.968" end="00:55:35.368" style="s2">son.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.288" end="00:55:41.568" style="s2">At next Monday&#39;s board meeting, the</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.968" end="00:55:41.568" style="s2">Sterling family will support Damon.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.503" end="00:55:46.008" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.048" end="00:55:46.008" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company seal.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.368" end="00:55:51.728" style="s2">From now on, anything you sign gets</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.008" end="00:55:51.728" style="s2">stamped directly. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.288" end="00:55:56.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what kind of consequences this</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.688" end="00:55:59.688" style="s2">could cause?</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.688" end="00:55:59.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll handle [music] the board.</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.088" end="00:56:08.368" style="s2">Starting today, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.248" end="00:56:08.368" style="s2">your decision is Ross&#39;s decision.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.648" end="00:56:16.168" style="s2">Lucas met with my mother today.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.848" end="00:56:16.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.568" end="00:56:20.208" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucas [music] told her you&#39;re from a</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.808" end="00:56:21.688" style="s2">collateral branch of the Sterling</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.208" end="00:56:23.608" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.688" end="00:56:24.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother won&#39;t believe it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.608" end="00:56:25.848" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.423" end="00:56:26.848" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.848" end="00:56:28.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I&#39;m not the one she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.848" end="00:56:30.568" style="s2">investigating.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.728" end="00:56:31.968" style="s2">You are.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.568" end="00:56:34.608" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know her well? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.968" end="00:56:37.288" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been at Ross for 3 months.</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.608" end="00:56:40.488" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s late. Don&#39;t stay up.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.288" end="00:56:40.488" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re running out of time.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.568" end="00:56:45.128" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.968" end="00:56:49.208" style="s2">You&#39;re still investigating the Lane</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.328" end="00:56:50.728" style="s2">case.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.208" end="00:56:53.328" style="s2">Damon keeps having me organize old</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.728" end="00:56:53.328" style="s2">files.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.928" end="00:56:58.848" style="s2">Stop pretending.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.768" end="00:57:01.608" style="s2">You&#39;ve accessed the Lane case more times</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.848" end="00:57:04.328" style="s2">than all the other cases combined.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.608" end="00:57:05.928" style="s2">Old cases are worth studying.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.328" end="00:57:08.968" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.928" end="00:57:11.249" style="s2">Money? Shares? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.968" end="00:57:13.289" style="s2">The truth.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.249" end="00:57:15.409" style="s2">The truth is</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.289" end="00:57:17.929" style="s2">your father signed the papers and took</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.409" end="00:57:17.929" style="s2">the money.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.289" end="00:57:22.329" style="s2">He was responsible for the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.129" end="00:57:26.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who forced him to sign?</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.649" end="00:57:33.329" style="s2">By the way,</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.649" end="00:57:38.209" style="s2">your son gave me the company seal.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.089" end="00:57:45.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother came to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.729" end="00:57:47.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She told me to stop investigating the</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.209" end="00:57:47.929" style="s2">Lane case.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.889" end="00:57:52.689" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you still going to investigate her?</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.729" end="00:57:55.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.689" end="00:57:57.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then keep digging.</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.529" end="00:57:58.649" style="s2">The top floor safe.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.169" end="00:58:01.169" style="s2">All the original Lane case [music] files</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.649" end="00:58:01.169" style="s2">are in there.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.889" end="00:58:05.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why give this to me?</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.689" end="00:58:06.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you want to know the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.295" end="00:58:08.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.409" end="00:58:08.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.009" end="00:58:32.150" style="s2">Your father entrusted everything to him.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.249" end="00:58:33.889" style="s2">He took the company and he threw me out,</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.150" end="00:58:37.289" style="s2">[music] too.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.889" end="00:58:37.289" style="s2">But he never kept his promise.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.729" end="00:58:45.209" style="s2">That&#39;s why he owes me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.569" end="00:58:45.209" style="s2">She opened the top floor safe.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.449" end="00:58:50.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The plan changes at tomorrow&#39;s board</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.209" end="00:58:51.849" style="s2">meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.209" end="00:58:53.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How?</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.849" end="00:58:55.730" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nominate Claire Sterling for vice</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.889" end="00:58:57.750" style="s2">president of Ross.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.730" end="00:58:57.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.809" end="00:59:03.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s only been here 3 months.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.689" end="00:59:07.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she&#39;s elected, she&#39;ll owe the board.</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.929" end="00:59:10.729" style="s2">If she isn&#39;t, Damon loses credibility.</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.569" end="00:59:10.729" style="s2">Either way, I win.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.649" end="00:59:17.931" style="s2">The first item, the vote on the review</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.891" end="00:59:17.931" style="s2">of Damon&#39;s authority is deferred.</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.091" end="00:59:18.811" style="s2">Now,</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.655" end="00:59:22.371" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.811" end="00:59:24.771" style="s2">&gt;&gt; let&#39;s discuss a new proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.371" end="00:59:27.371" style="s2">I nominate Claire Sterling as vice</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.771" end="00:59:29.011" style="s2">president of Ross Group responsible for</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.371" end="00:59:31.156" style="s2">the Westside project and government</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.011" end="00:59:31.156" style="s2">partnership. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.531" end="00:59:35.891" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I object.</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.686" end="00:59:38.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.891" end="00:59:40.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she not qualified?</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.411" end="00:59:44.051" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.651" end="00:59:45.731" style="s2">But I wasn&#39;t told about this proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.051" end="00:59:48.371" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A board proposal doesn&#39;t require your</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.731" end="00:59:48.371" style="s2">approval.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.651" end="00:59:54.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Sterling family seconds the motion.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.131" end="00:59:56.091" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The motion is seconded.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.451" end="00:59:58.571" style="s2">Vote.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.091" end="00:59:58.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.211" end="01:00:06.211" style="s2">Do you want the position?</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.451" end="01:00:11.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take it. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.651" end="01:00:11.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vote.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.291" end="01:00:19.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Passed. Effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.881" end="01:00:22.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.741" end="01:00:32.411" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.491" end="01:00:34.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She put you up there because she wants</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.411" end="01:00:34.971" style="s2">to watch you fall.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.636" end="01:00:38.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.971" end="01:00:41.186" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The higher I stand, the more I can see.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.731" end="01:00:41.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You accepted on purpose?</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.186" end="01:00:43.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.531" end="01:00:48.291" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The position isn&#39;t what I want.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.851" end="01:00:48.291" style="s2">Before, all I could see was his back.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.491" end="01:00:51.731" style="s2">Now I can see all of him.</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.651" end="01:00:53.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After Claire entered the vice</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.731" end="01:00:55.451" style="s2">president&#39;s office, she accessed three</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.571" end="01:00:56.451" style="s2">files. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.451" end="01:00:58.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which ones?</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.451" end="01:01:00.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Westside project, the joint venture,</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.251" end="01:01:02.571" style="s2">and the Lane case.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.571" end="01:01:03.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So she kept investigating after all.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.571" end="01:01:05.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.171" end="01:01:06.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should we stop [music] her?</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.131" end="01:01:09.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.571" end="01:01:10.811" style="s2">Let her investigate.</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.251" end="01:01:12.131" style="s2">Notify Damon.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.811" end="01:01:13.971" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.131" end="01:01:15.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Family dinner [music] next Friday. Tell</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.971" end="01:01:16.932" style="s2">him to bring Claire.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.251" end="01:01:19.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to use the family dinner to</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.932" end="01:01:20.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I built her a stage.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.012" end="01:01:22.572" style="s2">Of course I want to see how she</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.052" end="01:01:24.412" style="s2">performs.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.572" end="01:01:26.452" style="s2">Two things today.</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.412" end="01:01:29.212" style="s2">Welcome Claire as Ross&#39;s new vice</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.452" end="01:01:29.212" style="s2">president.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.132" end="01:01:34.812" style="s2">And let&#39;s celebrate the completion of</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.812" end="01:01:36.252" style="s2">the joint venture in advance.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.812" end="01:01:38.812" style="s2">I heard you access the Lane case [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.252" end="01:01:38.812" style="s2">files.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.092" end="01:01:42.012" style="s2">That was one of Damon&#39;s early projects.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.772" end="01:01:43.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Organizing the archives requires</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.012" end="01:01:44.012" style="s2">reviewing old files.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.012" end="01:01:46.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were very thorough.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.012" end="01:01:46.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, eat.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.852" end="01:01:54.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t drink the wine just now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.092" end="01:01:56.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t drink.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.412" end="01:01:59.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is something wrong with the left side of</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.292" end="01:01:59.132" style="s2">your face?</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.772" end="01:02:06.212" style="s2">What are you afraid of?</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.772" end="01:02:06.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.932" end="01:02:11.372" style="s2">Someone inside is looking for you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.172" end="01:02:11.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.692" end="01:02:17.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother just tried to touch your face.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.572" end="01:02:20.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wanted to check the left [music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.572" end="01:02:22.372" style="s2">side of my face.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.132" end="01:02:24.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with your face?</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.372" end="01:02:24.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.092" end="01:02:33.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You call this nothing?</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.612" end="01:02:35.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you kick me out because of this?</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.732" end="01:02:38.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I wanted you gone, I would have done</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.172" end="01:02:38.172" style="s2">it a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.053" end="01:02:44.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.012" end="01:02:46.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll make a doctor&#39;s appointment</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.092" end="01:02:46.532" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.692" end="01:02:52.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you helping me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.772" end="01:02:54.652" style="s2">You didn&#39;t stop me from investigating</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.212" end="01:02:57.532" style="s2">the Lane case.</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.652" end="01:02:57.532" style="s2">Do you know something?</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.732" end="01:03:01.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know anything. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.092" end="01:03:12.012" style="s2">This is a friend of mine. He&#39;s here to</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.732" end="01:03:13.332" style="s2">look at your face.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.012" end="01:03:16.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.332" end="01:03:16.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let the doctor take a look first.</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.613" end="01:03:25.693" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The left side of her face is responding</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.293" end="01:03:26.933" style="s2">notably slower. When did this start?</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.693" end="01:03:28.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A month ago.</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.933" end="01:03:29.853" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you been injured there before?</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.533" end="01:03:31.693" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.853" end="01:03:33.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need further [music] tests.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.693" end="01:03:35.533" style="s2">Get a CT scan and an EMG as soon as</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.653" end="01:03:37.413" style="s2">possible.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.533" end="01:03:40.693" style="s2">Set it up for tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.413" end="01:03:40.693" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;ll go myself.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.573" end="01:03:50.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This problem with her face didn&#39;t start</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.213" end="01:03:52.973" style="s2">recently.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.533" end="01:03:52.973" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.653" end="01:03:56.413" style="s2">What you asked for.</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.689" end="01:03:59.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.309" end="01:04:01.893" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.493" end="01:04:04.693" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The money passed through Damon and</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.893" end="01:04:06.093" style="s2">ultimately ended up with Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.693" end="01:04:08.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, the one who really wanted the Lane</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.093" end="01:04:11.013" style="s2">family assets was her.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.613" end="01:04:12.293" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re still missing the last piece.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.013" end="01:04:15.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The record [music] showing the</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.293" end="01:04:18.013" style="s2">authorization was signed by proxy.</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.613" end="01:04:19.693" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.013" end="01:04:21.093" style="s2">I have the original.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.693" end="01:04:22.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When are you going public with it?</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.093" end="01:04:25.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After the board meeting.</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.813" end="01:04:27.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pick the time, I&#39;ll cooperate.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.213" end="01:04:29.213" style="s2">By the way,</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.013" end="01:04:30.533" style="s2">Damon had a doctor examine your face?</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.213" end="01:04:32.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s looking for an answer he&#39;s afraid</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.533" end="01:04:36.893" style="s2">to face.</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.653" end="01:04:36.893" style="s2">Damon had a doctor examine Claire today.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.973" end="01:04:42.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Examine what?</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.693" end="01:04:44.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An abnormality in her face. The problem</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.053" end="01:04:45.333" style="s2">only became visible after she moved into</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.053" end="01:04:47.133" style="s2">Damon&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.333" end="01:04:48.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.133" end="01:04:49.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This didn&#39;t [music] happen to her all of</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.333" end="01:04:51.213" style="s2">a sudden.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.653" end="01:04:52.493" style="s2">Add another proposal to next week&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.213" end="01:04:53.733" style="s2">board meeting.</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.493" end="01:04:55.293" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.733" end="01:04:58.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A security review [music] of the people</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.293" end="01:05:01.013" style="s2">staying at Damon&#39;s private residence.</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.933" end="01:05:03.013" style="s2">First item, confirmation of the vice</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.013" end="01:05:05.333" style="s2">president appointment.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.013" end="01:05:06.853" style="s2">Second item, a security review of the</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.333" end="01:05:08.013" style="s2">people staying at Damon&#39;s private</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.853" end="01:05:09.453" style="s2">residence.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.013" end="01:05:11.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My private residence is outside the</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.453" end="01:05:12.613" style="s2">company&#39;s jurisdiction.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.053" end="01:05:13.693" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The board has a right to know who she</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.613" end="01:05:17.253" style="s2">is.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.693" end="01:05:17.253" style="s2">All in favor, raise your hands.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.373" end="01:05:21.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I object.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.220" end="01:05:23.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.533" end="01:05:25.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s one of Ross&#39;s people. Anything</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.535" end="01:05:27.455" style="s2">else doesn&#39;t require an explanation to</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.095" end="01:05:27.455" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.215" end="01:05:30.700" style="s2">That proposal exceeds the board&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.655" end="01:05:30.975" style="s2">authority.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.700" end="01:05:33.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.975" end="01:05:35.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree to submit my information.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.415" end="01:05:38.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.135" end="01:05:38.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll provide my background information.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.935" end="01:05:42.975" style="s2">As for anything you can&#39;t find,</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.335" end="01:05:45.455" style="s2">there&#39;s nothing I can do about that.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.975" end="01:05:48.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Submit it within 3 days.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.455" end="01:05:48.255" style="s2">Meeting adjourned.</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.815" end="01:05:52.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you crazy?</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.095" end="01:05:55.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she wants to investigate, I&#39;ll give</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.415" end="01:05:55.775" style="s2">her something to investigate.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.775" end="01:06:04.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Signing this is basically betting your</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.455" end="01:06:07.015" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.415" end="01:06:08.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria won&#39;t be able to find Claire</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.015" end="01:06:10.295" style="s2">because</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.495" end="01:06:12.455" style="s2">Claire doesn&#39;t exist.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.295" end="01:06:14.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;ll investigate something else.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.455" end="01:06:17.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The deeper she digs,</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.055" end="01:06:17.895" style="s2">the closer she gets to her own secret.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.695" end="01:06:23.100" style="s2">Lucas,</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.015" end="01:06:25.895" style="s2">board meeting in 3 days. Have the bank</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.100" end="01:06:25.895" style="s2">[music] records ready.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.975" end="01:06:36.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the records are complete.</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.935" end="01:06:44.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too complete.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.751" end="01:06:44.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.716" end="01:06:47.975" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.935" end="01:06:51.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we investigate next?</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.975" end="01:06:52.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t investigate Claire.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.495" end="01:06:55.735" style="s2">Investigate [music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.615" end="01:06:55.735" style="s2">Sophia Lane.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.775" end="01:07:04.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Third item, the cross-border acquisition</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.295" end="01:07:08.295" style="s2">funding plan.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.095" end="01:07:08.295" style="s2">The current funding gap is too large.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.895" end="01:07:14.255" style="s2">If the investment fails, the company&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.815" end="01:07:14.255" style="s2">cash flow will take a hit.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.935" end="01:07:18.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.095" end="01:07:21.535" style="s2">are you worried about the project</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.375" end="01:07:25.376" style="s2">failing</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.535" end="01:07:25.376" style="s2">or about your own shares losing value.</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.416" end="01:07:31.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you stay with Damon, you&#39;ll only fall</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.056" end="01:07:32.216" style="s2">with him in the end.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.221" end="01:07:34.576" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.216" end="01:07:36.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just doing my job.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.576" end="01:07:37.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you really think he can protect you?</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.461" end="01:07:41.096" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.856" end="01:07:41.096" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trust Mr. Ross.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.536" end="01:07:51.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The contract is breaking down.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.526" end="01:07:53.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.536" end="01:07:55.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The person you want will fall soon,</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.936" end="01:07:56.816" style="s2">and I&#39;m about to disappear, too.</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.656" end="01:07:58.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let it end.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.816" end="01:08:01.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you forget? Rule number one of the</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.936" end="01:08:02.896" style="s2">contract, if the host gives up</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.256" end="01:08:06.416" style="s2">voluntarily,</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.896" end="01:08:06.416" style="s2">the spirit pays the price.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.496" end="01:08:09.776" style="s2">Wait until he falls.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.136" end="01:08:12.016" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll leave.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.832" end="01:08:14.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.016" end="01:08:14.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look for me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.416" end="01:08:21.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.736" end="01:08:35.696" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mirror image of Victoria&#39;s private</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.256" end="01:08:35.696" style="s2">server.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.896" end="01:08:41.776" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you get it?</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.136" end="01:08:41.776" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.936" end="01:08:47.536" style="s2">She thought this was her backup plan.</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.776" end="01:08:51.696" style="s2">Now it&#39;s your [music] knife.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.856" end="01:09:00.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s on it?</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.376" end="01:09:02.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something she left behind 3 years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.176" end="01:09:04.576" style="s2">Enough to scare her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.176" end="01:09:07.416" style="s2">No, thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.576" end="01:09:07.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.376" end="01:09:18.096" style="s2">I want Damon out.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.176" end="01:09:19.736" style="s2">Help me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.096" end="01:09:21.456" style="s2">The vice president position will still</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.736" end="01:09:23.536" style="s2">be yours.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.456" end="01:09:25.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just an assistant.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.536" end="01:09:27.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Assistants often know more than anyone</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.378" end="01:09:27.898" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.297" end="01:09:31.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That merger money,</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.817" end="01:09:32.338" style="s2">Mr. Ross had me change the payment route</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.458" end="01:09:33.657" style="s2">twice.</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.338" end="01:09:35.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.657" end="01:09:36.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.097" end="01:09:38.538" style="s2">He just told me to do it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.697" end="01:09:41.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.538" end="01:09:43.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The contract binds hatred, not people. I</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.018" end="01:09:44.697" style="s2">don&#39;t ask who you are, and I don&#39;t ask</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.018" end="01:09:45.817" style="s2">who you want to bring down. I only</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.697" end="01:09:46.657" style="s2">collect the price.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.817" end="01:09:48.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.657" end="01:09:51.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once he falls, I&#39;ll leave.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.737" end="01:09:51.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.538" end="01:09:56.218" style="s2">Mr. Ross, the board is requiring an</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.778" end="01:09:57.738" style="s2">internal audit. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.218" end="01:09:59.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then keep digging.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.738" end="01:10:01.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They want 3 years of approvals and fund</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.538" end="01:10:05.097" style="s2">flow records pulled.</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.738" end="01:10:05.097" style="s2">This could drag you into it, too.</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.978" end="01:10:18.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pull every financial approval from the</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.418" end="01:10:18.258" style="s2">past 3 years.</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.538" end="01:10:31.938" style="s2">Will he trace it back to you?</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.177" end="01:10:32.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. He&#39;ll investigate [music] Victoria</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.938" end="01:10:36.378" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.698" end="01:10:39.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if she realizes she has no way out?</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.378" end="01:10:39.978" style="s2">You&#39;re becoming more like your old self.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.978" end="01:10:44.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.218" end="01:10:45.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Has he been seeing you a lot</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.458" end="01:10:48.657" style="s2">lately?</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.177" end="01:10:48.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aaron, you should go home.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.898" end="01:11:05.258" style="s2">Do you remember this person?</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.458" end="01:11:15.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.938" end="01:11:19.819" style="s2">This medication</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.898" end="01:11:20.498" style="s2">isn&#39;t for that condition.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.819" end="01:11:24.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.498" end="01:11:24.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you to prescribe it?</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.978" end="01:11:33.339" style="s2">Who pressured you to issue the report?</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.699" end="01:11:40.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that enough?</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.939" end="01:11:43.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough?</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.939" end="01:11:47.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, can you stop now?</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.939" end="01:11:47.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s still one thing left.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.979" end="01:11:56.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still don&#39;t understand you humans.</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.939" end="01:11:57.155" style="s2">You traded me for your hatred. When the</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.019" end="01:11:57.259" style="s2">hatred is gone,</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.155" end="01:11:59.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.259" end="01:12:00.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what will you have left?</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.339" end="01:12:03.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.259" end="01:12:03.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;re more pitiful than I am.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.184" end="01:12:16.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.539" end="01:12:18.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once you hand it over, there&#39;s no going</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.939" end="01:12:20.059" style="s2">back. They&#39;ll definitely investigate the</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.819" end="01:12:21.659" style="s2">source of the report, [music] too.</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.059" end="01:12:24.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; List the source as an internal audit</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.659" end="01:12:27.579" style="s2">leak. They&#39;ll investigate Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.379" end="01:12:27.579" style="s2">They won&#39;t trace it back to me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.139" end="01:12:37.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What right do you have to take me away?</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.939" end="01:12:43.819" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.499" end="01:12:43.819" style="s2">It was someone inside.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.059" end="01:12:50.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, tell them the truth. Say something.</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.859" end="01:12:53.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether you&#39;re pregnant has nothing to</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.579" end="01:12:53.299" style="s2">do with me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.179" end="01:13:06.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon, the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.819" end="01:13:06.419" style="s2">Damon.</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.739" end="01:13:09.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to come back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.979" end="01:13:24.139" style="s2">It&#39;s late. What [music] is it?</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.499" end="01:13:30.699" style="s2">Why did you lock the door?</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.716" end="01:13:38.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.460" end="01:13:48.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did this come [music] from?</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.540" end="01:13:51.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From what you signed 3 years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.500" end="01:13:51.940" style="s2">Did you ever ask where it came from?</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.660" end="01:13:56.820" style="s2">3 days before my father died.</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.100" end="01:14:00.100" style="s2">This is your handwriting.</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.260" end="01:14:03.260" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you really?</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.460" end="01:14:06.180" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 years ago you handed me flowers at my</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.260" end="01:14:06.180" style="s2">father&#39;s funeral.</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.220" end="01:14:11.860" style="s2">You said, &quot;I&#39;m sorry for your loss.&quot;</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.300" end="01:14:11.860" style="s2">Then you turned around and signed this.</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.340" end="01:14:16.300" style="s2">I&#39;m Sophia Lane.</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.660" end="01:14:21.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.060" end="01:14:21.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You thought I was dead?</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.700" end="01:14:25.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All this time?</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.620" end="01:14:26.460" style="s2">Was it all an act?</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.300" end="01:14:27.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.460" end="01:14:30.540" style="s2">Whatever kind of Claire you wanted,</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.820" end="01:14:31.340" style="s2">that&#39;s the Claire I played.</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.540" end="01:14:32.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.340" end="01:14:33.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I&#39;m only giving back what you</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.620" end="01:14:35.980" style="s2">gave me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.900" end="01:14:37.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In these 3 years, was there ever even</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.980" end="01:14:40.060" style="s2">one time</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.900" end="01:14:41.700" style="s2">that was real?</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.060" end="01:14:43.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.700" end="01:14:45.380" style="s2">Because you loved that perfect woman,</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.781" end="01:14:47.820" style="s2">not the Sophia you all looked down on</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.380" end="01:14:49.860" style="s2">back then.</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.820" end="01:14:52.860" style="s2">The evidence has been submitted. The law</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.860" end="01:14:52.860" style="s2">can handle the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.281" end="01:14:59.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
